<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10738" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντλ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄντλος</span>
			, i.e., </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>hold of a ship,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				482
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἀντλίαν φυλάξω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					434
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεῖπνον . . ἐξ ἀντλίας
			ἥκοντα,</span> i.e. the coarse food used by seamen, <i><span class="en">
				Dionys.Com.
				2.41
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>bilge-water, filth,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				17
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>reservoir</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1120.26
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PRyl.</u>
				92.5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii/iii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καδίσκος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
